==Strategy==
The basic way to beat these stages is to bring several strong meatshields and at least one Cat with both Area Attack and more than 200 range. Just be careful with the restriction. Early game players should be able to slowly, but easily clear these stages with Bahamut Cat, while more advanced players should make use of [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs]] to quickly clear these stages.

